ame in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 that same pair ran 57% of normal on the middle, and January to February ran 51%. For 2026 so far, April to May came in at 60% and June to July at 130% on the middle. Grid 25125 had its driest year in 1965 at 63% of normal.</p>"}
